e/read files specified the Task sections\n- **NO DUPLICATE KEYS** — each JSON object must have unique keys; duplicates cause silent data loss and parsing errors\n- **NEVER touch sysIds** — do not create, modify, or remove them; the controller generates these automatically and removing them breaks field mapping\n- **Stick to the documented length limits** — enforced by the required `ue:validating-template-fields` call in Task 4, not by memory\n\n# Tasks\n\nUse the `Task` Tools to manage the flow of the execution.\nWhen creating the Task Definitions create it with this methodology:\n\n```\n<Agent Name>: <Task Name>\n```\n\n## Task 1: Pull Latest Template\n\nPull the latest template from UAC Controller as a precaution to get any controller-generated sysIds:\n\n```bash\nuip pull\n```\n\nAll outcomes are fine to continue — `uip pull` failures just mean the extension isn't deployed yet.\n\n## Task 2: Gather Context\n\nUse `ue:retrieving-context` skill to read:\n- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/retrieving-context/references/template_docs/ue-template-structure.md` — Template JSON structure and critical rules\n- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/retrieving-context/references/template_docs/ue-template-examples.md` — Examples\n- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/retrieving-context/references/template_docs/ue-template-standard-fields.md` — Standard field properties and types\n- `${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/skills/retrieving-context/references/template_docs/ue-template-standard-extension-fields.md` — Extension-specific fields and output fields\n\nRead all **Input Files** listed in the prompt.\n\n## Task 3: Build Template\n\n**Populate `\"fields\"` array** — add ALL input and output fields from analysis:\n- Order fields as specified in the analysis `Field Ordering` section\n- Each field from the analysis must appear exactly once — do not map the same field twice\n- Apply validation rules and field dependencies from analysis\n- Configure dynamic choice fields with `choiceDynamic: true` and `choiceFields` array\n\n**Populate `\"commands\"` array** — ONLY if analysis has a Dynamic Commands section:\n- Add each command with name, label, requiredFields, availableStatuses\n- Order commands alphabetically\n- If no Dynamic Commands section exists, leave as empty array `[]`\n\n## Task 4: Verify\n\n```bash\npython -m json.tool <Output File>\n```\n\nConfirm:\n- Valid JSON with no duplicate keys\n- All fields from analysis included with required properties\n- Sequential field numbering (1, 2, 3 — not 1, 5, 3)\n- No unsupported properties (`version`, `xPath`)\n- Exactly ONE `extensionStatus: true`\n- All existing sysIds preserved unchanged\n\nUse the `ue:validating-template-fields` skill against the output\nfile. If it reports any violation, shorten the offending value and re-run the\nskill before continuing — do not leave a template with an unresolved\nviolation.\n\n\n---\nWork Item ID: initial-1\nInput Files:\n- memory/initial-1/implementation-blueprint.md\nOutput Files:\n- Extension template: extension-code/src/templates/template.json\n"}

