2026-09-11 08:17:06 - Received stdin data: {"session_id":"7a7099f0-8f12-4ef1-bc08-29e5fabbbff8","transcript_path":"/tmp/.claude/projects/-tmp-aws-s3-file-upload/7a7099f0-8f12-4ef1-bc08-29e5fabbbff8.jsonl","cwd":"/tmp/aws-s3-file-upload","permission_mode":"bypassPermissions","effort":{"level":"high"},"hook_event_name":"PostToolUse","tool_name":"Read","tool_input":{"file_path":"/tmp/iss-ue-plugin/claude/uac/ue/skills/retrieving-context/references/template_docs/ue-template-examples.md"},"tool_response":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/tmp/iss-ue-plugin/claude/uac/ue/skills/retrieving-context/references/template_docs/ue-template-examples.md","content":"# Complete Template Examples\n\n## Minimal REST API Extension\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Simple REST API\",\n  \"extension\": \"ue-simple-rest-api\",\n  \"description\": \"Execute REST API calls\",\n  \"templateType\": \"Extension\",\n  \"variablePrefix\": \"rest_api\",\n  \"agentType\": \"Any\",\n  \"exitCodeProcessing\": \"Success Exitcode Range\",\n  \"exitCodes\": \"0\",\n  \"outputReturnType\": \"STDOUT\",\n  \"outputType\": \"TEXT\",\n  \"runtimeDir\": null,\n  \"alwaysCancelOnFinish\": true,\n  \"fields\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"api_url\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Text Field 1\",\n      \"label\": \"API URL\",\n      \"hint\": \"Full URL of the API endpoint\",\n      \"required\": true,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"credentials\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Credential Field 1\",\n      \"label\": \"API Credentials\",\n      \"hint\": \"Username and password for API authentication\",\n      \"required\": true,\n      \"allowVariable\": true,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"response\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Text Field 10\",\n      \"label\": \"API Response\",\n      \"hint\": \"Response from the API call\",\n      \"fieldRestriction\": \"Output Only\",\n      \"extensionStatus\": true,\n      \"defaultListView\": true,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Multi-Action CRUD Extension\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"Resource Manager\",\n  \"extension\": \"ue-resource-manager\",\n  \"description\": \"Create, read, update, and delete resources\",\n  \"templateType\": \"Extension\",\n  \"variablePrefix\": \"resource_mgr\",\n  \"agentType\": \"Any\",\n  \"exitCodeProcessing\": \"Success Exitcode Range\",\n  \"exitCodes\": \"0\",\n  \"outputReturnType\": \"STDOUT\",\n  \"outputType\": \"TEXT\",\n  \"runtimeDir\": null,\n  \"alwaysCancelOnFinish\": true,\n  \"fields\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"api_endpoint\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Text Field 1\",\n      \"label\": \"API Endpoint\",\n      \"required\": true,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"credentials\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Credential Field 1\",\n      \"label\": \"Credentials\",\n      \"required\": true,\n      \"allowVariable\": true,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"action_type\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Choice Field 1\",\n      \"label\": \"Action\",\n      \"required\": true,\n      \"fieldValue\": \"Create\",\n      \"choiceAllowEmpty\": false,\n      \"choiceAllowMultiple\": false,\n      \"choiceSortOption\": \"Sequence\",\n      \"choiceDynamic\": false,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2,\n      \"choices\": [\n        {\n          \"fieldValue\": \"Create\",\n          \"sequence\": 0,\n          \"useFieldValueForLabel\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"fieldValue\": \"Get\",\n          \"sequence\": 1,\n          \"useFieldValueForLabel\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"fieldValue\": \"Update\",\n          \"sequence\": 2,\n          \"useFieldValueForLabel\": true\n        },\n        {\n          \"fieldValue\": \"Delete\",\n          \"sequence\": 3,\n          \"useFieldValueForLabel\": true\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"resource_name\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Text Field 2\",\n      \"label\": \"Resource Name\",\n      \"hint\": \"Name for the new resource\",\n      \"showIfField\": \"Choice Field 1\",\n      \"showIfFieldValue\": \"Create\",\n      \"requireIfVisible\": true,\n      \"noSpaceIfHidden\": true,\n      \"preserveValueIfHidden\": false,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"resource_description\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Large Text Field 1\",\n      \"label\": \"Resource Description\",\n      \"hint\": \"Description of the resource\",\n      \"showIfField\": \"Choice Field 1\",\n      \"showIfFieldValue\": \"Create,Update\",\n      \"noSpaceIfHidden\": true,\n      \"preserveValueIfHidden\": false,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"resource_id\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Text Field 3\",\n      \"label\": \"Resource ID\",\n      \"hint\": \"ID of the resource to retrieve, update, or delete\",\n      \"showIfField\": \"Choice Field 1\",\n      \"showIfFieldValue\": \"Get,Update,Delete\",\n      \"requireIfVisible\": true,\n      \"noSpaceIfHidden\": true,\n      \"preserveValueIfHidden\": false,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"created_resource_id\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Text Field 10\",\n      \"label\": \"Created Resource ID\",\n      \"hint\": \"ID of the created resource\",\n      \"fieldRestriction\": \"Output Only\",\n      \"extensionStatus\": true,\n      \"defaultListView\": true,\n      \"preserveOutputOnRerun\": true,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"execution_result\",\n      \"fieldMapping\": \"Text Field 11\",\n      \"label\": \"Result\",\n      \"hint\": \"Result of the operation\",\n      \"fieldRestriction\": \"Output Only\",\n      \"extensionStatus\": true,\n      \"defaultListView\": true,\n      \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Complex Layout Scenarios\n\n### Two-Column Layout for Compact Forms\n\n**Use formColumnSpan: 1 for:**\n- Boolean fields (checkboxes)\n- Small integer fields (ports, counts)\n- Short text fields (codes, IDs)\n- Choice fields with short labels\n\n**Example Layout:**\n```\nRow 1: [Use SSL (Boolean)] [Port (Integer)]\nRow 2: [Timeout (Integer)] [Retry Count (Integer)]\n```\n\n**Template Configuration:**\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"use_ssl\",\n    \"formStartRow\": true,\n    \"formEndRow\": false,\n    \"formColumnSpan\": 1\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"port\",\n    \"formStartRow\": false,\n    \"formEndRow\": true,\n    \"formColumnSpan\": 1\n  }\n]\n```\n\n---\n\n### Full-Width Layout for Complex Fields\n\n**Use formColumnSpan: 2 for:**\n- Large text fields (descriptions, JSON payloads)\n- Array fields (headers, parameters)\n- Script fields (code, SQL)\n- Long text fields (URLs, file paths)\n- Credential fields\n\n**All full-width fields typically have:**\n```json\n{\n  \"formStartRow\": true,\n  \"formEndRow\": true,\n  \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Conditional Field Groups with Clean Layouts\n\n**Problem:** When action changes, conditional fields should appear/disappear without leaving gaps.\n\n**Solution Pattern:**\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"action_field\",\n  \"formStartRow\": true,\n  \"formEndRow\": true,\n  \"formColumnSpan\": 2\n},\n{\n  \"name\": \"conditional_field_1\",\n  \"showIfField\": \"Choice Field 1\",\n  \"showIfFieldValue\": \"ActionA\",\n  \"noSpaceIfHidden\": true,\n  \"formStartRow\": true,\n  \"formEndRow\": false,\n  \"formColumnSpan\": 1\n},\n{\n  \"name\": \"conditional_field_2\",\n  \"showIfField\": \"Choice Field 1\",\n  \"showIfFieldValue\": \"ActionA\",\n  \"noSpaceIfHidden\": true,\n  \"formStartRow\": false,\n  \"formEndRow\": true,\n  \"formColumnSpan\": 1\n}\n```\n\n**Key Points:**\n- Always set `noSpaceIfHidden: true` on ALL conditional fields\n- Group related conditional fields on same rows\n- All fields in the group must have same `showIfField` logic\n\n---\n\n## Common Pitfalls & Solutions\n\n### 1. Forgotten noSpaceIfHidden\n\n**Problem:** Form has large gaps when conditional fields are hidden.\n\n**Symptoms:**\n- Empty rows in form where conditional fields should be\n- Inconsistent form height when switching actions\n\n**Solution:**\n```json\n{\n  \"showIfField\": \"Choice Field 1\",\n  \"showIfFieldValue\": \"SomeAction\",\n  \"noSpaceIfHidden\": true  // ALWAYS add this\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### 2. Choice Field Array Handling in Extension Code\n\n**Problem:** Extension code expects string but Choice fields return arrays.\n\n**Incorrect:**\n```python\nif input_data.action_type == \"Create\":  # WRONG - comparing list to string\n    ...\n```\n\n**Correct:**\n```python\nif input_data.action_type[0] == \"Create\":  # Always index [0] for single select\n    ...\n\n# For multi-select\nif \"Create\" in input_data.action_type:\n    ...\n```\n\n---\n\n### 3. Output Fields Cluttering Input Form\n\n**Problem:** Many output fields make input form confusing.\n\n**Solution Strategy:**\n- Use `defaultListView: true` only on most important output fields (1-2 max)\n- Other output fields remain in task details but not in list view\n- Group all output fields at bottom of template\n- Use clear labels indicating these are outputs\n\n---\n\n### 4. Non-Sequential Field Mappings\n\n**Problem:** Using \"Text Field 1\", \"Text Field 5\", \"Text Field 3\" (gaps and out of order)\n\n**Why It's Bad:**\n- Harder to track which mappings are available\n- Difficult to add new fields later\n- Confusing when reviewing template\n\n**Solution:**\nAlways use sequential numbering:\n```\nText Field 1\nText Field 2\nText Field 3\nChoice Field 1\nChoice Field 2\nBoolean Field 1\nInteger Field 1\n```\n\n---\n\n### 5. Over-Engineering Validation with fieldRegex\n\n**Problem:** Complex regex patterns that reject valid user input or cause confusion.\n\n**Example Bad Pattern:**\n```json\n{\n  \"fieldRegex\": \"^(?:[a-z0-9!#$%&'*+/=?^_`{|}~-]+(?:\\\\.[a-z0-9!#$%&'*+/=?^_`{|}~-]+)*|\\\"(?:[\\\\x01-\\\\x08\\\\x0b\\\\x0c\\\\x0e-\\\\x1f\\\\x21\\\\x23-\\\\x5b\\\\x5d-\\\\x7f]|\\\\\\\\[\\\\x01-\\\\x09\\\\x0b\\\\x0c\\\\x0e-\\\\x7f])*\\\")@(?:(?:[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]*[a-z0-9])?\\\\.)+[a-z0-9](?:[a-z0-9-]*[a-z0-9])?|\\\\[(?:(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?)\\\\.){3}(?:25[0-5]|2[0-4][0-9]|[01]?[0-9][0-9]?|[a-z0-9-]*[a-z0-9]:(?:[\\\\x01-\\\\x08\\\\x0b\\\\x0c\\\\x0e-\\\\x1f\\\\x21-\\\\x5a\\\\x53-\\\\x7f]|\\\\\\\\[\\\\x01-\\\\x09\\\\x0b\\\\x0c\\\\x0e-\\\\x7f])+)\\\\])$\"\n}\n```\n\n**Better Approach:**\n- Omit `fieldRegex` from template\n- Validate in extension Python code where you can:\n  - Provide clear error messages\n  - Handle edge cases gracefully\n  - Update validation logic without template changes\n\n---\n\n### 6. Incorrect requireIfVisible Usage\n\n**Problem:** Field marked as `required: false` but should be required when visible.\n\n**Wrong:**\n```json\n{\n  \"required\": true,  // WRONG - makes field always required, even when hidden\n  \"showIfField\": \"Choice Field 1\",\n  \"showIfFieldValue\": \"ActionA\"\n}\n```\n\n**Correct:**\n```json\n{\n  \"required\": false,\n  \"requireIfVisible\": true,  // Required only when shown\n  \"showIfField\": \"Choice Field 1\",\n  \"showIfFieldValue\": \"ActionA\"\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n- **ue-template-structure.md** - High-level template structure overview\n- **ue-template-standard-fields.md** - Template-level properties\n- **ue-template-standard-extension-fields.md** - Field properties reference\n- **universal-template-properties.mdx** - Complete UAC specification","numLines":404,"startLine":1,"totalLines":404}},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K2a17VPknCmwWWJZJpns2Q","duration_ms":1}

