nt(f\"  minReleaseLevel: {template.get('minReleaseLevel')}\")\nprint(f\"  commands: {len(template.get('commands', []))}\")\nprint(f\"  events: {len(template.get('events', []))}\")\n\nprint(\"\\n✓ Template structure verification complete\")\nEOF\n","description":"Verify template structure and fields"},"tool_use_id":"toolu_01W8UQoc9xtrpGDxEkJrHBVo"}

